<title>BELGIUM: PetroFina to publish H1 report Aug 31.</title>
<headline>PetroFina to publish H1 report Aug 31.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian oil group PetroFina will publish its earnings report on the first half of 1997 on Thursday, August 31, a company spokeswoman said on Monday.</p>
<p>The report will be released after the 1630 hours (1430 GMT) close of the Brussels bourse.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
